  "description": "Since his debut, popular actor Kang Ha-young has enjoyed a smooth career with no scandals, other than the occasional dating rumor. With looks and charm that could make anyone fall in love, his one hidden secret is that he has been rejected twice by his first love and best friend, Han Tae-seok.\n\nEven so, Ha-young still can’t let go of his feelings for Tae-seok. One day, he discovers that Tae-seok actually has a boyfriend - and worse, it turns out that everyone in their friend group knew except him.\n\n*\"I’m handsome, I’ve got a great personality... so why on earth did he turn me down?\"*\n\nAs the saying goes, third time’s the charm. Ha-young launches his third attempt at winning over his childhood friend’s heart.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/3withyou)",
